          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The concept of
            %em projective bundle
            is the generalization of that of
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/projective+space"} projective space
            from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+spaces"} vector spaces
            to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+bundles"} vector bundles
          %h2#Definition Definition
          %p
            For
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi π
                    %mi E
                  %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                  %mi E
                  %mo →
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \pi_E \colon E \to X
            a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+vector+bundle"} topological vector bundle
            over some
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+field"} topological field
            = succeed "," do
